      "spam": false,
      "value": "Implement this, and raids will just be performed by people using a unique blueprint id for each avatar, completely breaking this solution. It's trivial to make a world with multiple avatar pedestals that are each the same exact avatar but a different ID for each one.",
      "viewerReactions": null
