      "spam": false,
      "value": "@{595459a74f08c21baf12e507|full_name}: While it does sound like little effort, that might be just enough to act as a deterrent for the majority of cases. Most spontaneous raid participants aren't coordinated enough to go around ensuring they all have unique avatars.\n\nThere are absolutely going to be avatar variants and other factors that would prevent this from being a catch all solution. Dedicated organized raids with the sole goal of being annoying are going to find a way around most countermeasures. But this will definitely help manage most of the spontaneous raids that casual players are participating in just because it's popular.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
